.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

# IDEs
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/skills/
